Katie had 7 pages of math homework and 3 pages of reading homework.
Each page has 9 problems on it.

Total math homework pages = 7
Total reading homework pages = 3
Total pages = 7 + 3 = 10
Total problems = Total pages * Number of problems per page
Total problems = 10 * 9 = 90

